There was a small bug in SignalWatchers() which rendered the last update
useless!  So time to release it again now.  Everything has been bumped to
v1.0 although there are still a few known bugs.  These will be addressed, 
as will ZAPP, in the weeks to come.  For now, however, we've got a show to 
do and it's time to finish this wee beasty off...

Released: 10-Apr-96
